{"applicationId":"harberger-amm","applicationRevision":"1","builder":{"contact":"https://github.com/ToanPham247","githubLogin":"ToanPham247","githubUserId":"173402366"},"contract":{"id":"public-pr-application-v3","submissionStandard":"2.0.0","validatorProfile":"intent-open-world-v1","version":"3.1.0"},"declarations":{"historicalEvidencePreserved":true,"noApprovalClaim":true,"noInheritedApproval":true,"noSecretsDeclared":true,"noUniswapEndorsementClaim":true,"publicInformationAcknowledged":true},"fidelity":{"reasonCode":null,"requirementBindings":[],"schemaVersion":"1.0.0","status":"unassessed"},"intentCapture":{"agentInterpretationStatus":"unconfirmed","captureStatus":"captured-verbatim-public-safe","facts":[{"confirmationStatus":"unconfirmed","id":"builder-public-idea","provenance":"owner-stated","sourceReferences":["original-idea"],"statement":"Harberger AMM — a Uniswap v4 hook.\n\nAn always-for-sale AMM hook: LPs self-price their custodied liquidity, pre-pay a continuous Harberger tax rebated to active LPs, and anyone can buy them out at that price; unfunded liquidity is recycled.\n\nUser outcome: A creator launches a WETH-paired token whose liquidity is always-for-sale: LPs self-price their share claims, pay a continuous tax rebated to all LPs, and anyone can buy out a claim at the self-price; tax-exhausted claims are liquidated by redistributing shares to remaining LPs.\n\nWhy v4: Only a v4 hook can (a) custody a single full-range position while minting ERC-6909 share claims to LPs, (b) collect the mandatory 10 bps volume fee non-bypassably through quadrant-dependent beforeSwap/afterSwap return deltas, and (c) enforce permissionless buyout and liquidation of self-priced claims atomically, from aggregate pool state with no keeper, upgrade or admin authority.\n"}],"ideaSourcePath":"submission-v2/idea-source.v1.json","ideaSourceRepositoryRef":"primary","ideaSourceSha256":"sha256:ee486ddc8db6016ffc758a4fd435ce90c396be56805a4685511e6c4827f7981e","language":"und","originalIdeaDisplayExcerpt":"Harberger AMM — a Uniswap v4 hook.\n\nAn always-for-sale AMM hook: LPs self-price their custodied liquidity, pre-pay a continuous Harberger tax rebated to active LPs, and anyone can buy them out at that price; unfunded liquidity is recycled.\n\nUser outcome: A creator launches a WETH-paired token whose liquidity is always-for-sale: LPs self-price their share claims, pay a continuous tax rebated to all LPs, and anyone can buy out a claim at the self-price; tax-exhausted claims are liquidated by redistributing shares to remaining LPs.\n\nWhy v4: Only a v4 hook can (a) custody a single full-range position while minting ERC-6909 share claims to LPs, (b) collect the mandatory 10 bps volume fee non-bypassably through quadrant-dependent beforeSwap/afterSwap return deltas, and (c) enforce permissionless buyout and liquidation of self-priced claims atomically, from aggregate pool state with no keeper, upgrade or admin authority.\n","schemaVersion":"1.0.0","unresolvedMaterialDecisions":["The builder idea is captured, but its architecture has not been interpreted or confirmed yet."]},"lineage":{"kind":"new","previous":null},"policyBindings":{"feeApplicability":"not-selected","feePolicyInstancePath":null,"feePolicyInstanceRepositoryRef":null,"feePolicyInstanceSha256":null,"feePolicySchemaId":null,"feePolicySchemaPath":null,"feePolicySchemaRepositoryRef":null,"feePolicySchemaSha256":null,"programmableFeePolicyHash":null,"programmableFeePolicyHashPreimage":null,"programmableFeePolicyId":null,"programmableFeePolicyVersion":null,"submissionPath":"submission-v2/submission.v2.json","submissionRepositoryRef":"primary","submissionSha256":"sha256:b00a252e5af228e4ce34ef07dc8275d581870207ee58539015677aaee0a95ae6"},"reviewPackage":{"records":[{"byteLength":1358,"kind":"compatibility-report","mediaType":"application/json","path":"compatibility-report.json","repositoryRef":null,"sha256":"sha256:ed61ad8342211557190fbe6fc0029b14531dc39f4243e543f19fbfb2404dd19d","sour